WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.348 --> 00:00:15.835
A long time ago, there lived a young boy whose name was Arthur.

2
00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:21.157
Arthur lived in a small village in England with his uncle, aunt, and cousin Kay.

3
00:00:22.137 --> 00:00:27.480
Arthur had many chores and duties around the house, but in his heart he longed to become a

4
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.709
knight. One day Arthur went to the market with his aunt.

5
00:00:32.429 --> 00:00:35.991
Suddenly a soldier on his horse rode through the middle of the road.

6
00:00:36.331 --> 00:00:37.551
He was shouting something.

7
00:00:37.571 --> 00:00:39.692
"The king is dead!

8
00:00:40.853 --> 00:00:42.393
King Uther is dead!"

9
00:00:42.994 --> 00:00:43.934
shouted the soldier.

10
00:00:44.574 --> 00:00:45.475
Everyone stopped.

11
00:00:45.995 --> 00:00:47.475
Some people began to cry.

12
00:00:47.936 --> 00:00:49.236
Others began to pray.

13
00:00:49.736 --> 00:00:51.437
The king of England was dead.

14
00:00:52.437 --> 00:00:53.898
Who would be their ruler now?

15
00:00:55.078 --> 00:00:58.660
During this time there lived a magician by the name of Merlin.

16
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.162
Merlin gathered the people together in front of a stone.

17
00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:06.184
The blade of a great sword was stuck inside the stone.

18
00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:14.889
He said, "The man who pulls this sword out of the stone will become the next king of

19
00:01:15.009 --> 00:01:22.053
England." Many men tried and tried but did not succeed.

20
00:01:22.853 --> 00:01:27.896
Only the one whose destiny was to be king would be able to pull the sword out.

21
00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:32.802
"Arthur," said his uncle one evening.

22
00:01:32.822 --> 00:01:36.163
"My son Kay is going to become a great knight.

23
00:01:36.764 --> 00:01:38.865
A great knight needs a great sword.

24
00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:42.647
Tomorrow you will go and find a sword for Kay."

25
00:01:44.128 --> 00:01:46.169
Arthur set out early the next morning.

26
00:01:46.669 --> 00:01:49.491
He did not know where to find a sword for his cousin.

27
00:01:50.231 --> 00:01:52.752
Arthur walked and walked for a long time.

28
00:01:53.373 --> 00:01:54.653
Suddenly he stopped.

29
00:01:55.354 --> 00:01:57.055
Arthur could not believe his eyes.

30
00:01:57.615 --> 00:01:59.076
A sword in a stone!

31
00:01:59.888 --> 00:02:01.749
Arthur walked closer to the sword.

32
00:02:02.209 --> 00:02:03.369
It was magnificent!

33
00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:06.311
His uncle would be very happy.

34
00:02:07.391 --> 00:02:09.632
Arthur did not know he was being watched.

35
00:02:10.272 --> 00:02:12.253
He grabbed the handle and pulled.

36
00:02:12.773 --> 00:02:15.354
The sword slid easily out from the stone.

37
00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:18.396
Suddenly Merlin appeared before Arthur.

38
00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:24.958
"Your Majesty," said Merlin as he got down on his knee and bowed to Arthur.

39
00:02:25.798 --> 00:02:26.799
Arthur was scared.

40
00:02:27.179 --> 00:02:29.200
He did not know who the old man was.

41
00:02:30.412 --> 00:02:32.013
"Wh-who are you?"

42
00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:34.274
Arthur asked.

43
00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:37.615
Merlin rose and approached Arthur.

44
00:02:37.635 --> 00:02:40.897
"I am Merlin the magician.

45
00:02:41.517 --> 00:02:44.218
You are Arthur, king of England."

46
00:02:45.559 --> 00:02:46.980
"How did you know my name?

47
00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:48.901
What did you call me?"

48
00:02:49.801 --> 00:02:51.122
Arthur was confused.

49
00:02:51.762 --> 00:02:55.784
"You are the king of England, my lord," answered Merlin.

50
00:02:57.528 --> 00:03:01.250
"Only the true king can pull the sword from the stone.

51
00:03:01.911 --> 00:03:05.053
You, Arthur, are actually King Uther's son.

52
00:03:05.633 --> 00:03:09.395
You are the next king of England," Merlin told Arthur.

53
00:03:10.376 --> 00:03:13.438
Gradually people began to gather in front of the stone.

54
00:03:14.018 --> 00:03:18.221
They were surprised to see a young peasant boy holding the grand sword.

55
00:03:19.942 --> 00:03:24.324
Soon the entire village heard that the sword had found its owner.

56
00:03:24.344 --> 00:03:28.406
Arthur's uncle, aunt, and cousin pushed to the front of the crowd.

57
00:03:28.807 --> 00:03:30.748
"What is the meaning of this, Arthur?"

58
00:03:31.228 --> 00:03:32.829
his uncle shouted angrily.

59
00:03:32.849 --> 00:03:35.350
"Whose sword do you hold in your hand?

60
00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.171
Is it not Kay's?"

61
00:03:38.472 --> 00:03:42.074
Arthur tried to explain, but Merlin put his hand up.

62
00:03:42.974 --> 00:03:48.797
"You will not speak in such a manner to your king," Merlin said to Arthur's uncle.

63
00:03:49.798 --> 00:03:51.679
Arthur's uncle blinked his eyes.

64
00:03:51.699 --> 00:03:53.360
"King? Arthur?"

65
00:03:54.512 --> 00:03:56.593
Arthur's aunt fainted at the news.

66
00:03:57.633 --> 00:03:59.053
Merlin looked at the crowd.

67
00:03:59.073 --> 00:04:01.454
"People of England!

68
00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:04.135
Behold your new king!"

69
00:04:07.116 --> 00:04:09.176
The crowd bowed down to Arthur.

70
00:04:09.876 --> 00:04:14.218
Then they shouted together, "Long live the king!

71
00:04:14.238 --> 00:04:16.838
Long live the king!"

72
00:04:18.159 --> 00:04:22.280
Arthur became king and ruled England with Merlin at his side.

73
00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:24.321
Arthur was a great king.

74
00:04:24.701 --> 00:04:26.682
He fought and won many battles.

75
00:04:27.702 --> 00:04:30.584
King Arthur met and fell in love with Guinevere.

76
00:04:31.284 --> 00:04:34.225
Soon they were married, and she became his queen.

77
00:04:34.906 --> 00:04:38.087
They lived in Arthur's castle, which was called Camelot.

78
00:04:39.308 --> 00:04:44.090
Inside Camelot, Arthur formed a society called the Knights of the Round Table.

79
00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:48.012
Only the bravest and most courageous knights could be members.

80
00:04:48.684 --> 00:04:53.005
The table was round because King Arthur believed everyone was an equal member.

81
00:04:55.386 --> 00:04:58.147
King Arthur became close friends with one of his knights.

82
00:04:59.167 --> 00:05:01.568
He was a young Frenchman named Lancelot.

83
00:05:02.668 --> 00:05:06.769
Lancelot spent a lot of time at Camelot with Arthur and Queen Guinevere.

84
00:05:08.049 --> 00:05:11.710
England became stronger and more prosperous under Arthur's rule.

85
00:05:12.911 --> 00:05:17.972
Finally, during one battle, Arthur's sword broke and his army lost the fight.

86
00:05:18.928 --> 00:05:22.669
Arthur knew he needed to find a stronger and more powerful sword.

87
00:05:22.689 --> 00:05:28.811
"Merlin, where can I find a sword that will win all of England's wars?

88
00:05:29.471 --> 00:05:32.812
A sword so powerful it can conquer all of England's enemies?"

89
00:05:33.392 --> 00:05:34.173
Arthur asked.

90
00:05:36.193 --> 00:05:41.455
"There is only one sword that can do this, my lord," Merlin answered.

91
00:05:41.475 --> 00:05:44.676
"Take me to it," Arthur said.

92
00:05:46.024 --> 00:05:49.767
Merlin took Arthur to the entrance of a deep shadowed forest.

93
00:05:49.787 --> 00:05:53.871
"My king," Merlin said to Arthur.

94
00:05:53.891 --> 00:05:58.595
"Once you enter this forest, your life will change forever."

95
00:05:58.615 --> 00:06:00.717
"I am ready, Merlin.

96
00:06:01.197 --> 00:06:06.122
Let us go," King Arthur said as he stepped bravely into the forest.
